WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.260
Two hours.

2
00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:03.460
126 marks.

3
00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:06.790
Four big questions, one for each theme.

4
00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.160
Each question splits into
four parts, worth 3 marks,

5
00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:13.670
then 6, then 6, then 15.

6
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:16.070
Look at those two 6-mark parts.

7
00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:19.760
Same size, but they do not
ask for the same thing.

8
00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:22.660
So what does each part
really want from you?

9
00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:25.790
In this mission, you'll climb
a ladder of command words,

10
00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:29.540
from Name and State all
the way up to Discuss.

11
00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:33.150
Then you'll take apart a
15-mark answer about marriage,

12
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.580
one labelled paragraph at a time.

13
00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:40.050
Your mission: find out what each part
of the question really wants from you.
